\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 The system must explicitly support the Indian framework.\
The DPDP Act requires consent to be:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 free\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 specific\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 informed\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 unambiguous\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 capable of withdrawal with comparable ease\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 and places the evidentiary burden on the Data Fiduciary to demonstrate that appropriate notice and consent were given. ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dpdpact2023.com/chapter-2?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 DPDP Act 2023}})\
The Act also allows Data Principals to manage consent through a Consent Manager, which is a distinct regulatory concept from simply having an internal consent-management system. ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dpdpact2023.com/chapter-2?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 DPDP Act 2023}})\
The final DPDP Rules were notified in November 2025. The important implementation dates are phased, with Consent Manager provisions becoming applicable in November 2026 and the major substantive obligations from May 2027. ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.meity.gov.in/documents/act-and-policies/digital-personal-data-protection-rules-2025-gDOxUjMtQWa?hl=en-US&utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 MeitY}})\
Therefore your platform should already have:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

