\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 55. My overall rating of the concept\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 For 
\f1\b UDS specifically
\f0\b0 , I'd score the opportunity:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 9.5/10
\f0\b0 \
Not because consent management itself is novel, but because 
\f1\b UDS has exactly the sort of fragmented, acquisition-driven, multi-platform technology environment where a centralized privacy fabric provides enormous value.
\f0\b0 \
The current regulatory window also gives you a good reason to do it now rather than later. India has already notified the DPDP Rules, and the substantive implementation runway runs into 2027. ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.meity.gov.in/documents/act-and-policies/digital-personal-data-protection-rules-2025-gDOxUjMtQWa?hl=en-US&utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 MeitY}})\
One caveat: I found several products called 
\f1\b Kavach/Kavach One/KAVACH
\f0\b0 , including Indian DPDP platforms, so I cannot confidently say which exact \'93Kavach1\'94 UDS currently uses. I therefore benchmarked the architecture against the broader current market rather than pretending those products were the same system.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

